cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "drunken-emu: an attention-deficit emulator for claude.ai artifacts"
abstract: >-
  Renders a single-file React artifact in headless Chromium and audits it as a
  reader with a scarce attention budget would meet it: taps found by visual
  affordance rather than DOM knowledge, an eight-stop non-linear skim instead
  of a linear read, thumb-sized hit targets, and horizontal-overflow detection.
  The audit is content-blind by construction so that the test cannot contain
  the answer; the accumulated judgment lives in the README rather than in the
  checks.
authors:
  - given-names: Yulin
    family-names: Li
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0004-0050-8688"
repository-code: "https://github.com/yulinl2/drunken-emu"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
